    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMerry Fishing Meow\u300b\u2014 A Relaxing &amp; Adorable Cat Fishing Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Merry<i>\u00a0Fishing Meow</i>! This is a charming and laid-back fishing game where you play as an adorable cat. Cast your line, unwind, and enjoy a purr-fectly delightful experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong><br>The game has a day-night system, offering different vibes\u2014whether it's the calm daylight or the serene, starry night. Every moment feels immersive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fish, Sell, and Earn</strong><br>Each round has a clear gold target. Catch fish to automatically sell them for coins\u2014but watch out for pesky seagulls! They might swoop in and snatch your hard-earned catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Rare Fish &amp; Big Rewards</strong><br>Occasionally, ultra-valuable rare fish appear. Can you reel them in for a huge payout? Luck and skill will decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Mystery Shop with Random Goods</strong><br>After each round, visit the shop to buy randomized items with varying stats and rarities. You can even spend coins to refresh the shop\u2014but budget wisely! Overspending might risk your next round\u2019s goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f <strong>Free Prayers for Blessings</strong><br>Your cat can perform a  prayer  for <i>free with\u00a0</i>graceful pose, receiving random buffs. Who knows? A little divine help might be just what you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Merry Fishing Meow</i>\u2014a cozy, cute, and relaxing fishing game where every cast brings joy!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300aMerry Fishing Meow\u300b\u2014 A Relaxing &amp; Adorable Cat Fishing Adventure!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Merry<i>\u00a0Fishing Meow</i>! This is a charming and laid-back fishing game where you play as an adorable cat. Cast your line, unwind, and enjoy a purr-fectly delightful experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf19 <strong>Day &amp; Night Cycle</strong><br>The game has a day-night system, offering different vibes\u2014whether it's the calm daylight or the serene, starry night. Every moment feels immersive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa3 <strong>Fish, Sell, and Earn</strong><br>Each round has a clear gold target. Catch fish to automatically sell them for coins\u2014but watch out for pesky seagulls! They might swoop in and snatch your hard-earned catch!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf1f <strong>Rare Fish &amp; Big Rewards</strong><br>Occasionally, ultra-valuable rare fish appear. Can you reel them in for a huge payout? Luck and skill will decide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Mystery Shop with Random Goods</strong><br>After each round, visit the shop to buy randomized items with varying stats and rarities. You can even spend coins to refresh the shop\u2014but budget wisely! Overspending might risk your next round\u2019s goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude4f <strong>Free Prayers for Blessings</strong><br>Your cat can perform a  prayer  for <i>free with\u00a0</i>graceful pose, receiving random buffs. Who knows? A little divine help might be just what you need!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into <i>Merry Fishing Meow</i>\u2014a cozy, cute, and relaxing fishing game where every cast brings joy!</p>",
